# hero-story Docker Compose environment template
# Copy this file to .env only when using this repository's Docker Compose stack.
# The .NET projects use appsettings.Development.json plus user secrets.
# The Vue frontend uses src/HeroStory.Frontend/.env.
# NEVER commit .env with real values. .env is gitignored.

